<title>MALAYSIA: Petronas Dagangan yr net up 1.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Petronas Dagangan yr net up 1.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		     (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 157.83	vs	  155.91</p>
<p>    Shr	    (cents)    40.3	 vs	   40.8</p>
<p>    Turnover		 3,898.29	vs	3,536.60</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   236.64	vs	  225.06</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    6.37	vs	  nil</p>
<p>    Dividend    (percent)   15.0	 vs	   15.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Petronas Dagangan Bhd is a unit of national oil company, Petroliam Nasional (Petronas). It distributes petroleum products in Malaysia.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
